    <tags>cymail cybrium security cli rust cross-platform admin</tags>
    <summary>SPF, DKIM, DMARC, MTA-STS and BIMI posture scoring</summary>
    <description>Email security scanner that evaluates SPF, DKIM, DMARC, MTA-STS, TLS-RPT, DANE and BIMI for a domain, scores the posture, and reports concrete remediation steps.

The Windows binary is Authenticode-signed by Cybrium Inc via Azure Trusted Signing. The install script downloads the release binary from GitHub, verifies its SHA-256 checksum, and refuses to install if the Authenticode signature is not valid. Verify after install with:

    Get-AuthenticodeSignature (Get-Command cymail).Source
</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/cybrium-ai/cymail/releases/tag/v0.7.1</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools/**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
